<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Biso Kogyo -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Biso Kogyo -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 10.37		vs	    9.71</p>
<p> Operating	  441    million    vs	  266    million</p>
<p> Current	    725    million    vs	  619    million</p>
<p> Net		  424    million    vs	  350    million</p>
<p> EPS		   49.10 yen	  vs	   43.35 yen</p>
<p> Shares		9 million	  vs	   8 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.75 yen	  vs	    6.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Tokyo Biso Kogyo Corp specialises in the cleaning and equipment management of buildings.</p>
</text>
